+        "guided": "Use the current mapped evidence and reliable structural classification as advisory guidance.",
+        "guided_evidence_only": "Use mapped timing evidence; no reliable transformation recommendation is available.",
+        "exploratory": "Choose an equivalent rewrite from the complete source; no reliable source-location guidance is supplied.",
